  "about": [
    "After graduating from the Faculty of Economics in Pula, I moved to Ljubljana where I am working on my Ph.D. in political anthropology on the domain of peasant social movements. I have been actively involved in illustration since 2014. I became recognized for my drawing style that successfully combines multiple techniques of illustration with great attention to details and free expression. In addition to the illustration, I’m also doing street art and screen printing.",
    "Main motive and also a channel in my illustrative work is portrait. Through that portrait I'm trying to communicate ideas and life of the person which portrait it is. In each illustration, whether on the wall or on paper, I want to build a story behind it, so every illustration is, in a way, socially engaged. With that engagement, I try to bring a certain social phenomena into public discourse."
  ],
